WEBVTT

01:49.350 --> 01:54.950
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.020 --> 01:57.990
[Episode 30]

01:58.310 --> 01:59.759
The defeat at Pingrong Battle

01:59.759 --> 02:01.620
plunged the country into sorrow.

02:01.710 --> 02:05.430
Gao Changyin and his followers colluded

02:02.250 --> 02:03.130
[Gao Residence]

02:05.590 --> 02:07.200
to execute schemes.

02:05.660 --> 02:06.560
[Gao Residence]

02:07.430 --> 02:10.240
They caused the deaths
of 20,000 Qianyu soldiers.

02:07.630 --> 02:11.400
[Sealed by the capital prefect Chu
following a royal command]

02:10.520 --> 02:11.980
Such unpardonable crimes

02:12.030 --> 02:13.360
are grounds for
confiscating their property,

02:13.360 --> 02:15.150
exiling them to the northern borders,

02:15.150 --> 02:18.380
and stripping them of
their official ranks and titles.

02:18.430 --> 02:20.120
All officials shall

02:20.190 --> 02:22.150
take this as a warning.

02:23.430 --> 02:25.829
Thank God I took
the Seventh Prince's side.

02:28.220 --> 02:31.670
[Yan Gate]

02:32.010 --> 02:35.130
[Five days later]

03:04.310 --> 03:06.520
Your Highness must be here to see me off.

03:12.000 --> 03:13.800
How is the Noble Consort?

03:14.910 --> 03:16.000
I heard from the prison guards

03:16.000 --> 03:18.660
that she fainted upon hearing
the news about me.

03:21.150 --> 03:22.280
Before coming here,

03:22.410 --> 03:23.940
I visited Mother.

03:24.360 --> 03:25.840
She was in shock,

03:26.240 --> 03:27.430
but now she is fine under the care

03:27.430 --> 03:28.630
of royal physicians.

03:30.630 --> 03:31.750
Glad to hear that.

03:35.190 --> 03:37.120
I feel the most guilty toward her

03:37.120 --> 03:38.240
of all people.

03:40.240 --> 03:41.840
When she was weak and little,

03:42.430 --> 03:44.150
I should've taken good care of her

03:44.150 --> 03:45.630
as her older brother.

03:48.120 --> 03:50.380
However, for the glory of the Gao family,

03:50.630 --> 03:51.990
I sent her to the palace

03:53.840 --> 03:56.170
and subjected her to a lifetime of misery.

03:58.430 --> 03:59.960
Uncle, during these years,

04:00.910 --> 04:03.170
you've done more than enough for Mother.

04:11.960 --> 04:13.020
Your Highness

04:14.020 --> 04:15.300
hates my guts, right?

04:22.200 --> 04:24.160
You did take control of my life,

04:26.120 --> 04:27.750
but you also gave me warmth

04:28.510 --> 04:29.640
and kept me company.

04:30.630 --> 04:31.890
You are a father figure

04:33.360 --> 04:34.159
and a mentor

04:34.600 --> 04:35.430
to me.

04:37.550 --> 04:38.530
Without you,

04:39.920 --> 04:41.980
I wouldn't have become who I am today.

04:42.830 --> 04:43.800
Maybe

04:45.040 --> 04:47.310
I won't live the way that you expect,

04:49.040 --> 04:50.240
but I promise you

04:51.400 --> 04:53.060
I will become a strong person,

04:54.270 --> 04:55.530
and that I will protect

04:56.920 --> 04:58.380
Mother and the Gao family.

05:09.370 --> 05:10.770
Rest assured, Uncle.

05:23.870 --> 05:24.820
Off you go.

05:29.390 --> 05:30.330
Just go.

05:55.950 --> 05:58.120
"To repay the Emperor's trust,

05:59.040 --> 06:01.320
I'll wield my sword and fight till I die."

06:02.390 --> 06:03.750
I, Gao Changyin,

06:05.920 --> 06:06.850
have no regrets.

06:12.950 --> 06:13.800
Go play.

06:13.800 --> 06:14.910
Your father's love

06:15.600 --> 06:17.460
and Chu Guihong's companionship

06:18.120 --> 06:20.120
will quickly vanish.

06:20.920 --> 06:22.800
Giving them your heart

06:23.480 --> 06:25.920
is giving them the right to hurt you.

06:28.240 --> 06:29.330
Without them,

06:29.560 --> 06:31.960
you can still become
a strong person, Heng.

06:34.480 --> 06:36.170
Wield the sword in your hand

06:36.740 --> 06:37.890
to fight for

06:38.630 --> 06:40.700
your own future on the battlefield.

06:44.430 --> 06:45.750
In this world,

06:46.510 --> 06:49.110
only Mother and Uncle
genuinely care about me.

06:49.630 --> 06:51.750
I must become a strong person

06:52.800 --> 06:54.800
to protect Mother and the Gao family

06:54.830 --> 06:55.920
in the future.

06:57.600 --> 07:02.860
[Improve Daily]

07:30.920 --> 07:32.370
The vile in office would

07:32.570 --> 07:34.230
erode the court's integrity.

07:34.430 --> 07:35.930
The evil in control would

07:36.040 --> 07:37.970
threaten the nation's wellbeing.

07:38.159 --> 07:39.800
The defeat at Pingrong Battle

07:39.800 --> 07:42.560
was largely attributed to
Gao Changyin and his illegal acts.

07:42.560 --> 07:44.220
He is now dead, upon consuming

07:44.390 --> 07:46.120
a poisoned drink as requested.

07:46.800 --> 07:47.780
But

07:48.000 --> 07:49.800
my heart still aches

07:48.920 --> 07:52.550
[Pure of Heart]

07:50.270 --> 07:52.710
for the wrongful deaths

07:53.190 --> 07:54.730
of 20,000 Qianyu soldiers,

07:54.890 --> 07:56.610
who were pillars of the state.

07:57.190 --> 07:59.360
I hereby bestow the highest honor on them

07:59.360 --> 08:01.390
and order them to be buried properly.

08:01.390 --> 08:04.790
Lanterns will be released
in memory of them in the city today.

08:04.920 --> 08:06.620
To console the martyrs' spirits,

08:06.620 --> 08:08.800
their stories will be
imparted to the commoners.

08:08.800 --> 08:10.570
Capital citizens may attend

08:10.630 --> 08:12.130
said memorial services

08:12.310 --> 08:13.870
to pay their respects.

08:27.190 --> 08:28.310
Han Sihu,

08:28.720 --> 08:30.120
your death is avenged.

08:30.560 --> 08:32.150
You can rest in peace now.

08:33.320 --> 08:34.390
Mian,

08:35.120 --> 08:38.179
the murderer of you
and your fellows has been executed.

08:38.320 --> 08:39.440
There are no wars

08:39.909 --> 08:41.909
to fight in heaven.

08:43.370 --> 08:45.100
My dear brother, rest in peace.

08:45.550 --> 08:46.810
If there is a next life,

08:46.870 --> 08:48.280
let us be

08:48.510 --> 08:50.320
guardians of Great Jing

08:50.390 --> 08:51.590
and the people again.

09:17.550 --> 09:18.610
As the saying goes,

09:19.050 --> 09:20.320
"The dead are gone,

09:20.840 --> 09:22.630
and the living shall move on."

09:25.030 --> 09:26.680
You are different

09:26.790 --> 09:27.850
from Gao Changyin.

09:28.740 --> 09:30.600
You did fail your supervisory duties,

09:30.600 --> 09:33.390
but you've cleared the names
of the dead soldiers.

09:33.390 --> 09:34.850
You shouldn't be held back

09:34.870 --> 09:36.800
by the aftermath of this incident.

09:39.230 --> 09:40.460
I understand.

09:42.240 --> 09:43.340
But the problem

09:44.030 --> 09:45.550
did arise because of me.

09:47.840 --> 09:50.320
Is this how you managed to fool everyone,

09:51.890 --> 09:53.640
by pretending to be guilty?

09:54.310 --> 09:55.120
Chu Guihong,

09:56.200 --> 09:57.840
the case about Pingrong Battle is closed.

09:57.840 --> 09:59.040
What more do you want?

09:59.160 --> 10:00.760
What do I want?

10:02.790 --> 10:05.350
I want the real culprit to pay a price!

10:05.440 --> 10:06.360
Can't you see?

10:07.000 --> 10:09.090
The real culprit has been executed.

10:09.120 --> 10:11.040
Why are you still after Nan Heng?

10:15.910 --> 10:17.670
A kind of wolf on the plains

10:18.990 --> 10:20.900
would leave the sheep's bones

10:22.440 --> 10:24.200
before the dog house

10:24.200 --> 10:25.930
after attacking the sheep pen.

10:26.070 --> 10:27.330
Then, the wolf

10:27.850 --> 10:29.450
would hide somewhere

10:29.890 --> 10:32.820
to watch the hound being
beaten to death by its owner.

10:35.960 --> 10:37.000
I am not a wolf,

10:39.640 --> 10:41.270
and my uncle was not a hound.

10:42.200 --> 10:43.510
All I want now

10:44.200 --> 10:45.200
is to make amends.

10:45.200 --> 10:46.630
You killed your close kin

10:46.630 --> 10:47.550
to conceal your errors.

10:47.550 --> 10:49.390
How dare you talk about making amends!

10:49.390 --> 10:51.650
What can you do to
make up for your wrongs?

10:53.630 --> 10:55.230
Then what do you want me to do?

10:57.970 --> 10:59.840
I wish my father stood right here.

11:00.390 --> 11:03.320
I wish those 20,000
Qianyu soldiers came back alive.

11:06.490 --> 11:07.970
I wish you were dead now.

11:08.910 --> 11:09.770
But can you make

11:10.840 --> 11:12.170
these wishes come true?

11:16.830 --> 11:17.810
Chu Guihong,

11:20.350 --> 11:22.180
I'm tired of explaining to you.

11:23.960 --> 11:25.120
I'll pay you

11:25.430 --> 11:27.290
on behalf of the Gao family for

11:28.150 --> 11:31.120
what my uncle owed you and
the 20,000 Qianyu soldiers.

11:31.120 --> 11:31.750
Nan Heng,

11:32.400 --> 11:33.860
don't do anything stupid.

11:33.910 --> 11:35.750
Do you think your false heartiness

11:35.750 --> 11:37.090
can make me forgive you?

11:37.960 --> 11:39.390
Nan Heng, listen up,

11:40.080 --> 11:41.540
there's nothing you can do

11:42.870 --> 11:43.900
to change the fact

11:46.240 --> 11:47.600
that we're enemies.

12:10.080 --> 12:10.870
Jixiang,

12:11.840 --> 12:13.640
do you think the dead can receive

12:13.840 --> 12:15.600
these lanterns on the river?

12:18.690 --> 12:19.930
When I was little,

12:20.470 --> 12:22.400
I used to set lanterns on the river.

12:22.630 --> 12:23.440
Back then,

12:24.290 --> 12:26.690
I prayed to my dead mother,

12:26.720 --> 12:28.800
hoping that I could win Nan Heng once.

12:30.510 --> 12:32.510
But my prayers were never answered.

12:32.800 --> 12:34.730
I was so frustrated at those times.

12:35.240 --> 12:36.740
Now that I think of it,

12:36.930 --> 12:38.730
I actually feel quite grateful.

12:49.790 --> 12:56.760
[To my mother]

13:00.500 --> 13:02.690
[To my mother in heaven:
May Great Jing be in peace forever]

13:04.270 --> 13:06.730
Heng is better suited
to be the crown prince.

13:11.760 --> 13:14.050
Well, I know I've let you guys down.

13:14.100 --> 13:15.630
But forcing me into this role

13:15.630 --> 13:17.000
won't bring good to Great Jing,

13:17.000 --> 13:17.790
will it?

13:21.840 --> 13:22.630
Jixiang,

13:23.130 --> 13:24.420
I'm telling you,

13:24.700 --> 13:26.720
I'll also get paid
for just being a prince.

13:26.720 --> 13:27.200
I promise

13:27.200 --> 13:28.360
you'll get your monthly salary

13:28.360 --> 13:29.790
in full or even more.

13:29.790 --> 13:30.360
If Heng

13:30.360 --> 13:31.550
h-has the guts to deny me

13:31.550 --> 13:32.240
that money,

13:32.240 --> 13:33.150
I-I'll beg him

13:33.150 --> 13:34.200
or yell at him. I...

13:34.200 --> 13:35.630
H-He has to give me money.

13:35.630 --> 13:36.840
He... Anyway...

13:40.390 --> 13:42.560
If you can't be promoted

13:42.780 --> 13:44.640
to the position of chief steward,

13:45.390 --> 13:46.960
will you still work for me?

13:52.360 --> 13:53.220
Your Highness,

13:53.790 --> 13:55.070
that position is usually

13:55.070 --> 13:56.200
filled by an eunuch.

13:57.850 --> 13:59.060
I'm not an eunuch.

14:06.750 --> 14:07.440
Jixiang.

14:07.840 --> 14:08.530
Jixiang,

14:09.130 --> 14:09.990
just listen,

14:10.010 --> 14:10.890
t-t-this...

14:12.160 --> 14:13.160
Anyway, I mean...

14:13.750 --> 14:14.280
Let's go.

14:14.440 --> 14:14.920
Put the lanterns

14:14.920 --> 14:15.650
on the river.

14:16.370 --> 14:23.210
[To my mother in heaven:
May Great Jing be in peace forever]

14:28.230 --> 14:29.230
How many lanterns

14:29.600 --> 14:30.390
do you want to release?

14:30.390 --> 14:31.080
I'll do it with you.

14:31.080 --> 14:31.630
10?

14:31.630 --> 14:33.030
We can make it 15 if you want.

14:33.030 --> 14:35.000
50 is also fine if necessary!

14:35.390 --> 14:36.200
No need.

14:36.670 --> 14:37.670
I have no family.

14:41.200 --> 14:43.100
But to honor Qianyu soldiers,

14:43.130 --> 14:45.200
we should at least release
100 lanterns, right?

14:45.200 --> 14:46.440
No need for that either.

14:46.440 --> 14:47.770
I don't know any of them.

14:48.080 --> 14:49.810
Why do you have to be a buzzkill?

14:54.940 --> 14:55.800
I have an idea.

14:57.480 --> 14:59.340
You can set one on the river for me.

14:59.550 --> 15:00.240
Right?

15:00.240 --> 15:01.440
Write something from your heart.

15:01.440 --> 15:03.000
I mean things you feel too embarrassed

15:03.000 --> 15:04.000
to put in a letter or express to me.

15:04.000 --> 15:05.270
Write them on a lantern then!

15:05.270 --> 15:06.080
Don't go away.

15:06.840 --> 15:08.240
We're not finished here!

15:09.080 --> 15:09.870
Jixiang!

15:10.270 --> 15:11.270
Oh, you.

15:11.270 --> 15:12.840
Why are you so shy?

15:12.840 --> 15:14.140
Slow down. Wait up!

15:14.170 --> 15:15.000
Look at you,

15:15.000 --> 15:16.200
acting like a stubborn donkey now.

15:16.200 --> 15:16.920
Jixiang!

15:24.250 --> 15:26.780
[Gentle Breeze, Pleasant Weather]

15:27.000 --> 15:28.210
Enough.

15:28.870 --> 15:30.120
You can't even handle

15:30.120 --> 15:31.440
your own love life.

15:32.080 --> 15:33.790
Stop giving me lectures.

15:35.000 --> 15:36.550
Instead of nagging here,

15:36.840 --> 15:38.000
you should go to Yiting's place

15:38.000 --> 15:39.600
and draw paintings with her.

15:40.240 --> 15:41.870
I'm not giving you lectures.

15:42.390 --> 15:44.080
I'm doing this for my own good.

15:45.240 --> 15:46.400
Which of these two

15:46.550 --> 15:47.750
looks prettier on me?

15:49.120 --> 15:49.870
Think about it.

15:49.870 --> 15:50.910
Chief is leaving,

15:50.910 --> 15:52.080
and I've lost my

15:52.080 --> 15:53.240
hard-earned job.

15:53.480 --> 15:54.670
Knock it off.

15:55.280 --> 15:56.750
You're a huge slacker.

15:56.750 --> 15:58.240
Would you happily take on a job?

15:58.240 --> 15:58.910
Besides,

15:59.200 --> 16:00.440
losing that job is just perfect.

16:00.440 --> 16:02.500
Yiting is waiting for you, isn't she?

16:02.550 --> 16:04.750
The Song family is wealthy.

16:05.080 --> 16:06.240
Being her husband,

16:06.390 --> 16:07.350
my friend,

16:07.600 --> 16:08.440
will at least

16:09.200 --> 16:10.870
save you 20 years of hard work.

16:11.670 --> 16:12.550
Sponging off a woman

16:12.550 --> 16:14.630
is not as satisfying as
earning my own bread.

16:14.630 --> 16:15.870
As the saying goes,

16:16.000 --> 16:18.750
"Getting in one's way to
wealth is committing murder."

16:18.750 --> 16:19.550
Look,

16:19.790 --> 16:20.600
Miss Song,

16:21.880 --> 16:23.840
you've saved my life once.

16:23.910 --> 16:26.600
It's only a virtuous act to do it again.

16:29.270 --> 16:30.790
Don't worry, Shangguan.

16:31.960 --> 16:34.100
Your chief won't be able to leave.

16:34.270 --> 16:35.840
The plots are set.

16:36.150 --> 16:38.210
No characters can escape their fate.

16:40.080 --> 16:40.870
What's more,

16:42.170 --> 16:43.080
I don't respond well to those

16:43.080 --> 16:44.120
who fish for sympathy.

16:44.120 --> 16:45.440
So drop the act.

16:49.140 --> 16:50.870
Which dress looks better on me?

16:51.100 --> 16:52.030
The blue one.

16:52.030 --> 16:53.760
It makes your skin look fairer.

16:54.620 --> 16:58.060
[Quietly Observe]

16:56.870 --> 16:57.670
Your Majesty,

16:58.630 --> 17:00.490
the registered Xuanjia soldiers

17:00.600 --> 17:02.080
amount to 23,600.

17:02.790 --> 17:05.430
The registry has been handed
over to the Ministry of War.

17:05.430 --> 17:06.890
This is the command token.

17:07.069 --> 17:09.000
Please take it back, Your Majesty.

17:25.680 --> 17:26.880
Rise, and we'll talk.

17:48.640 --> 17:50.130
The late Empress's death

17:50.350 --> 17:51.640
was not your fault.

17:57.880 --> 17:58.680
It was not.

18:00.350 --> 18:01.550
You didn't purposefully

18:01.550 --> 18:03.270
lead her to that path.

18:05.510 --> 18:06.110
I didn't.

18:07.550 --> 18:08.400
Why did you never

18:08.400 --> 18:10.340
explain it in all these years?

18:11.680 --> 18:13.050
I did once.

18:13.070 --> 18:14.240
When I was little...

18:21.270 --> 18:22.200
I'm sorry.

18:29.830 --> 18:30.850
Forget it.

18:31.070 --> 18:33.750
I know you've always resented me.

18:37.640 --> 18:38.440
I dare not.

18:48.640 --> 18:50.170
You keep the command token.

18:58.920 --> 18:59.870
When we

19:00.640 --> 19:04.030
planned for a setup to trap Gao Changyin,

19:04.160 --> 19:05.790
you promised to return your military power

19:05.790 --> 19:07.320
to me if our efforts failed.

19:07.750 --> 19:09.270
Now, we have succeeded.

19:09.320 --> 19:11.520
Gao Changyin has been executed as well.

19:11.750 --> 19:13.880
I give you my word

19:14.590 --> 19:15.720
that the whole thing

19:15.880 --> 19:17.200
is over now.

19:17.440 --> 19:18.900
I won't pursue it further.

19:23.150 --> 19:24.680
Many thanks, Your Majesty.

19:26.110 --> 19:26.970
In fact, I'm not

19:27.890 --> 19:29.820
afraid of being held accountable.

19:31.480 --> 19:33.410
I've come to understand one thing.

19:33.590 --> 19:35.210
What is it?

19:36.550 --> 19:37.550
My uncle

19:38.830 --> 19:40.750
caused innumerable deaths

19:41.440 --> 19:43.040
and committed severe crimes

19:44.070 --> 19:44.880
out of

19:45.880 --> 19:47.720
his greed for power.

19:49.680 --> 19:50.790
I was involved.

19:51.140 --> 19:52.940
My hands are no cleaner than his.

19:54.270 --> 19:55.070
Therefore,

19:55.750 --> 19:57.240
I'm no longer qualified to

19:58.160 --> 20:00.350
compete for what doesn't belong to me.

20:03.330 --> 20:05.100
Do you mean you want to

20:05.550 --> 20:07.270
retire from the army

20:07.680 --> 20:09.110
and quit your job?

20:16.160 --> 20:17.330
Condemn yourself

20:17.440 --> 20:19.750
all you want in your own mansion.

20:19.830 --> 20:20.680
But don't you ever

20:20.680 --> 20:21.880
think of resigning.

20:22.270 --> 20:23.480
To tell you the truth,

20:23.880 --> 20:24.640
I will

20:24.640 --> 20:26.070
not only make you stay,

20:26.440 --> 20:27.730
but also give you

20:27.880 --> 20:28.790
this.

20:29.160 --> 20:31.160
Open your eyes and look carefully!

20:42.620 --> 20:45.360
[The Seventh Prince Nan Heng
is qualified to be the crown prince]

20:45.490 --> 20:47.260
[Imperial Edict]

20:46.270 --> 20:47.070
Crown prince?

20:48.000 --> 20:48.680
Your Majesty...

20:48.680 --> 20:50.240
I met with Rui last night.

20:51.240 --> 20:52.250
He said

20:52.350 --> 20:54.240
he was inferior to you in all areas

20:54.240 --> 20:55.550
pertaining to

20:55.550 --> 20:57.290
managing the country.

20:57.550 --> 20:58.530
He also said

20:58.830 --> 20:59.830
that he always had

21:00.000 --> 21:02.030
my attention when he was upset.

21:02.750 --> 21:03.550
Meanwhile,

21:04.030 --> 21:05.400
nobody cared for you

21:05.570 --> 21:07.370
when you were unfairly treated.

21:10.030 --> 21:11.830
You were demoted to be a commoner

21:11.830 --> 21:13.830
for the theft in Jiangnan Province.

21:14.440 --> 21:15.270
Today,

21:16.270 --> 21:19.160
it is time I promoted you
to be the crown prince.

21:25.200 --> 21:26.000
Your Majesty.

21:28.710 --> 21:30.440
A criminal as I am doesn't deserve

21:30.440 --> 21:31.400
this position.

21:31.880 --> 21:32.750
Rui is

21:33.550 --> 21:34.590
pure of heart.

21:34.860 --> 21:36.660
He will make a benevolent ruler.

21:37.550 --> 21:38.790
A benevolent ruler?

21:39.440 --> 21:41.400
With that thick head of his,

21:41.400 --> 21:43.800
can he shoulder a ruler's responsibility?

21:46.550 --> 21:48.750
If you are to compensate
for the Gao family's doings,

21:48.750 --> 21:50.750
you shouldn't give up your military power.

21:50.750 --> 21:51.590
I'm not the one

21:52.270 --> 21:53.880
you should compensate.

21:55.270 --> 21:56.480
Correct your wrongs

21:57.550 --> 21:59.680
for Great Jing and the people instead.

22:07.400 --> 22:08.200
Get up.

22:09.350 --> 22:10.610
Take these things,

22:11.200 --> 22:11.880
and leave.

22:24.310 --> 22:25.200
Goodbye, then.

22:28.270 --> 22:30.110
You like Song Yimeng, don't you?

22:33.590 --> 22:34.440
Your Majesty,

22:36.000 --> 22:37.200
I do like Song Yimeng.

22:41.400 --> 22:42.200
I see.

22:43.240 --> 22:44.040
You may go now.

22:45.970 --> 22:46.630
Yes.

22:57.300 --> 22:59.210
[Quietly Observe]

23:42.200 --> 23:43.460
Are you waiting for me?

23:44.920 --> 23:45.720
Not really...

23:47.310 --> 23:48.900
Since you've said it out loud,

23:48.900 --> 23:50.610
I might as well

23:50.960 --> 23:52.070
a-a-admit

23:52.070 --> 23:53.200
I'm waiting for you.

23:55.270 --> 23:56.330
What's the matter?

23:56.880 --> 23:57.640
I...

24:00.200 --> 24:00.880
I...

24:08.440 --> 24:09.270
Heng,

24:10.880 --> 24:12.010
I owe you an apology.

24:15.640 --> 24:16.770
I was wrong about you

24:18.110 --> 24:19.310
in all these years.

24:20.310 --> 24:22.750
I shouldn't have mistaken you
for the killer of my mother,

24:22.750 --> 24:23.590
or treated you

24:24.510 --> 24:25.830
with hostility.

24:27.470 --> 24:28.940
If you're still mad at me,

24:29.320 --> 24:30.440
I can let you have

24:30.510 --> 24:31.570
my mansion,

24:31.590 --> 24:33.240
the jade kylin and the luminous pearl

24:33.240 --> 24:34.240
Father gave me.

24:34.240 --> 24:35.300
I don't need those.

24:35.830 --> 24:36.440
Are...

24:36.500 --> 24:37.630
Are they not enough?

24:42.970 --> 24:44.350
Or is it Jixiang what you want?

24:44.350 --> 24:45.270
Don't take him away.

24:45.270 --> 24:45.510
Look,

24:45.510 --> 24:46.440
I can give you anything,

24:46.440 --> 24:47.720
except for Jixiang.

24:47.720 --> 24:48.400
I mean,

24:48.400 --> 24:50.330
you don't need to give me anything.

24:52.720 --> 24:53.880
Your mother

24:54.680 --> 24:56.540
did die because of the Gao family.

24:56.720 --> 24:57.850
You had every reason

24:58.210 --> 24:59.270
to be mad at me.

25:01.100 --> 25:02.120
I knew I was right.

25:02.890 --> 25:04.620
You're most suited to be

25:05.310 --> 25:06.440
the crown prince.

25:13.680 --> 25:14.280
Come here.

25:21.440 --> 25:22.440
I have a question.

25:23.640 --> 25:26.270
Why did you generously
let me me have that position?

25:26.270 --> 25:27.400
You see,

25:27.680 --> 25:29.000
you are pure of heart.

25:29.440 --> 25:31.700
I believe you'll treat the people right.

25:32.880 --> 25:34.110
Pure of heart?

25:37.440 --> 25:39.130
Doesn't it take more to make

25:39.310 --> 25:40.170
a good emperor?

25:41.030 --> 25:42.030
Do you think

25:42.480 --> 25:43.480
I'm smart enough?

25:44.830 --> 25:45.550
Heng,

25:45.740 --> 25:47.010
to be honest,

25:47.440 --> 25:49.000
although I'm the chosen one

25:49.000 --> 25:50.310
and an amazing person,

25:50.590 --> 25:51.400
I'm really not

25:51.860 --> 25:53.720
cut out to be the crown prince.

25:54.350 --> 25:55.530
The crown prince

25:55.680 --> 25:57.610
should not only be compassionate,

25:57.750 --> 25:59.880
but also be intelligent enough
to fight the evil

25:59.880 --> 26:02.350
and to protect the people of Great Jing.

26:02.880 --> 26:04.610
Am I qualified in that respect?

26:04.750 --> 26:05.920
Apparently not.

26:05.920 --> 26:06.410
Right?

26:08.000 --> 26:09.410
But you're different.

26:09.880 --> 26:10.750
In these years,

26:10.930 --> 26:11.740
Father,

26:12.000 --> 26:12.720
Guihong

26:12.720 --> 26:13.680
and I

26:15.950 --> 26:18.040
all needed an outlet to vent

26:19.270 --> 26:20.870
our anger at Mother's death.

26:22.270 --> 26:23.070
You

26:23.830 --> 26:25.680
were the only outlet.

26:27.310 --> 26:28.580
We hated you

26:28.610 --> 26:29.610
and picked on you.

26:30.310 --> 26:32.130
But you still managed to
eliminate the evil chancellor

26:32.130 --> 26:34.060
and restore justice to the people.

26:34.550 --> 26:35.580
A man like you

26:37.640 --> 26:39.260
is truly the best candidate

26:39.290 --> 26:41.460
for the throne.

26:47.680 --> 26:48.440
Alright.

26:48.840 --> 26:50.220
Sometimes, I really don't know

26:50.220 --> 26:51.110
what smart guys

26:51.110 --> 26:52.230
like you are thinking.

26:52.230 --> 26:53.510
You keep mulling

26:53.510 --> 26:54.830
and mulling over a tiny issue

26:54.830 --> 26:55.590
like this.

26:55.590 --> 26:57.200
In the end, it is we little fools

26:57.200 --> 26:58.060
who sort it out.

26:59.440 --> 27:00.550
You're no fool.

27:01.830 --> 27:03.880
You're a prince of Great Jing.

27:04.300 --> 27:05.380
If anyone

27:05.720 --> 27:07.050
dares to call you a fool,

27:07.360 --> 27:08.690
I'll make him regret it.

27:16.960 --> 27:17.590
H...

27:23.920 --> 27:24.720
Heng,

27:24.720 --> 27:25.510
well,

27:25.510 --> 27:26.920
can I ask you something?

27:27.680 --> 27:28.630
Ask away.

27:29.350 --> 27:30.830
I was deeply moved just now.

27:30.830 --> 27:31.480
But...

27:31.610 --> 27:32.540
Can I address you

27:32.790 --> 27:34.440
in a more respectful way after some time?

27:34.440 --> 27:36.400
Doing it now will make me feel guilty

27:36.400 --> 27:37.440
about Guihong.

27:37.440 --> 27:38.440
Of course you can.

27:39.640 --> 27:40.270
Really?

27:40.790 --> 27:41.920
You've agreed to it?

27:42.830 --> 27:44.030
That's great!

27:45.650 --> 27:46.300
Alright.

27:46.680 --> 27:47.810
Here, Heng.

27:48.310 --> 27:48.880
Come on.

27:50.900 --> 27:51.440
Drink up!

28:11.960 --> 28:13.510
Guihong, what you said

28:13.510 --> 28:14.610
has reassured me.

28:14.640 --> 28:15.680
The two of us will

28:15.680 --> 28:17.920
stand in unity to achieve our goals.

28:17.960 --> 28:19.200
Even if there were 10 or 100

28:19.200 --> 28:20.070
more Nan Hengs,

28:20.070 --> 28:21.920
they wouldn't be our match.

28:22.440 --> 28:22.920
Right?

28:27.550 --> 28:29.070
Stand in unity...

28:30.360 --> 28:32.220
Nan Heng wouldn't be our match...

28:35.750 --> 28:36.920
But what about now?

28:38.390 --> 28:39.920
Men's minds easily change.

28:41.510 --> 28:43.110
What is there to hold onto?

28:53.360 --> 28:54.160
So be it.

28:56.550 --> 28:58.210
To live is to look forward.

28:59.790 --> 29:01.440
Nan Heng has pleaded guilty.

29:02.680 --> 29:03.640
Nothing else

29:04.780 --> 29:06.080
matters now.

29:13.000 --> 29:13.790
General Chu,

29:14.160 --> 29:14.960
there is a new

29:15.350 --> 29:16.280
imperial edict.

29:19.680 --> 29:20.740
Are you saying

29:20.880 --> 29:22.810
Chief has become the crown prince?

29:25.160 --> 29:26.940
So Song Yimeng was right.

29:27.000 --> 29:28.000
Of course!

29:29.960 --> 29:31.000
Yan, Huang,

29:31.000 --> 29:32.070
go prepare a feast.

29:32.070 --> 29:33.160
Today, let's have

29:33.160 --> 29:34.420
a proper celebration.

29:34.440 --> 29:35.100
-Yes!
-Yes!

29:37.820 --> 29:39.270
I still don't get it.

29:39.480 --> 29:41.160
Chief is the crown prince now.

29:41.270 --> 29:43.270
But what does that have to do with us?

29:43.330 --> 29:45.540
Is your brain filled with hay?

29:45.570 --> 29:46.820
Think about it.

29:47.030 --> 29:48.190
What does it mean to be the crown prince?

29:48.190 --> 29:50.880
It means to be the second
most esteemed person in the country.

29:50.880 --> 29:52.270
We Nightwalkers used to be

29:52.270 --> 29:53.830
nobodies from the martial arts world.

29:53.830 --> 29:56.490
We felt inferior
when we saw Qianyu soldiers.

29:56.680 --> 29:57.590
But from now on...

29:57.590 --> 29:58.570
From now on?

29:59.960 --> 30:01.250
They will feel

30:01.590 --> 30:03.350
inferior to us instead.

30:04.350 --> 30:05.160
Bring it in!

30:10.880 --> 30:12.280
Why are you presenting us

30:12.350 --> 30:13.310
these uniforms?

30:14.920 --> 30:17.440
As the crown prince's most valuable asset,

30:17.480 --> 30:19.680
I'm obligated to share
His Highness's burdens.

30:19.680 --> 30:20.830
Now, His Highness

30:21.000 --> 30:22.600
has become the crown prince.

30:22.790 --> 30:24.110
It's inappropriate

30:24.110 --> 30:25.440
for you to be around him.

30:25.570 --> 30:26.330
Look,

30:26.350 --> 30:27.820
though I feel reluctant,

30:27.840 --> 30:30.280
I'll still let you join Xuanjia Army.

30:31.880 --> 30:33.640
For the sake of our past friendship,

30:33.640 --> 30:34.440
I'll allow you

30:34.440 --> 30:37.040
to start as the lowest-ranked
military cooks.

30:38.540 --> 30:39.960
Mr. Fugui,

30:40.400 --> 30:41.640
what do you think

30:41.640 --> 30:42.590
you're doing,

30:42.590 --> 30:43.850
talking in your dream?

30:46.360 --> 30:47.490
You're not even

30:47.680 --> 30:49.920
intelligent to be a Nightwalker.

30:50.400 --> 30:52.070
I'm the second master of
the Waning River Crescent.

30:52.070 --> 30:54.110
Why would I join Xuanjia Army?

30:55.720 --> 30:57.440
Xuanjia Army needs

30:57.440 --> 31:00.640
someone useful, like Yunlong and Shanhu.

31:00.880 --> 31:01.960
As for you...

31:04.160 --> 31:05.440
Do you mean I'm not qualified?

31:05.440 --> 31:06.270
You are not.

31:06.270 --> 31:06.880
I am.

31:06.880 --> 31:07.590
You are not!

31:07.590 --> 31:08.650
Are you suggesting

31:08.720 --> 31:10.880
you're more needed by Chief?

31:15.010 --> 31:16.950
[Song Residence]

31:21.550 --> 31:22.350
Stop.

31:23.920 --> 31:24.660
Come back.

31:30.270 --> 31:31.050
Put it down.

31:40.180 --> 31:41.250
Mrs. Li,

31:41.880 --> 31:43.550
you've been in a fight
with Chief for a long time.

31:43.550 --> 31:44.680
Isn't it time to make up?

31:44.680 --> 31:45.350
My dear brother-in-law,

31:45.350 --> 31:46.310
try reflecting on yourself

31:46.310 --> 31:47.350
before lecturing others.

31:47.350 --> 31:48.960
When do I get to attend

31:48.960 --> 31:50.360
Yiting and your wedding?

31:50.440 --> 31:51.700
The next month,

31:51.750 --> 31:53.000
assuming no accidents.

31:53.000 --> 31:54.270
When did I say I'd get married?

31:54.270 --> 31:56.070
We'll wait till after
you marry His Highness.

31:56.070 --> 31:57.990
When did I say I'd get married?

31:59.070 --> 32:00.730
You're getting married soon.

32:00.920 --> 32:02.240
Stop making a fuss.

32:03.070 --> 32:05.750
The imperial edict designating
the crown prince has been issued.

32:05.750 --> 32:06.810
Will it be long before

32:06.810 --> 32:08.270
you two get engaged again?

32:22.070 --> 32:22.640
Right.

32:23.750 --> 32:24.550
I have to leave

32:25.160 --> 32:26.840
before those plots happen.

32:26.960 --> 32:27.750
Hesitation

32:27.750 --> 32:28.880
leads to disasters.

32:29.960 --> 32:30.660
Yiting,

32:30.790 --> 32:31.980
take good care of our father.

32:31.980 --> 32:33.150
I have to go now.

32:35.920 --> 32:36.720
You stop.

32:39.260 --> 32:40.120
Come back.

32:40.640 --> 32:41.640
Eat with me.

32:44.220 --> 32:47.130
[Righteousness and Virtue]

32:50.510 --> 32:53.640
[Imperial Edict]

32:57.110 --> 32:57.970
Your Highness,

32:58.550 --> 32:59.650
is Miss Song the reason

32:59.650 --> 33:01.580
that you want to decline the edict?

33:03.270 --> 33:04.470
What makes you say so?

33:05.440 --> 33:06.720
Miss Song

33:06.720 --> 33:08.720
has always thought of you as a bad person,

33:08.720 --> 33:09.680
while you have always

33:09.680 --> 33:11.680
tried to prove you're a good person.

33:11.830 --> 33:12.440
For that,

33:12.960 --> 33:13.740
Your Highness

33:13.740 --> 33:15.130
executed Chancellor Gao,

33:15.130 --> 33:16.250
uncovered the truth

33:16.250 --> 33:17.880
and pretended to hand over
the command token.

33:17.880 --> 33:19.160
Now, it is the best time

33:19.240 --> 33:22.270
for Your Highness to continue
acting like a real gentleman

33:22.270 --> 33:24.960
by declining the crown prince's position.

33:30.270 --> 33:31.160
Did I make

33:31.880 --> 33:33.480
an inaccurate analysis again?

33:33.480 --> 33:35.880
I should've added you
to the list of exiles,

33:36.060 --> 33:38.260
besides Chancellor Gao's supporters.

33:39.610 --> 33:40.610
Your Highness...

33:41.680 --> 33:42.310
Your Highness,

33:42.310 --> 33:44.370
there is a letter from Mr. Shangguan.

33:51.550 --> 33:53.020
Bad news, Chief.

33:53.040 --> 33:54.700
Song Yimeng is leaving again.

33:58.340 --> 33:58.700
[Nan Heng] [Chu Guihong]

33:58.700 --> 34:00.750
[Nan Heng]

34:00.750 --> 34:04.310
[Slacker Escape Plan]

34:23.670 --> 34:26.480
If I didn't know about
Nan Heng's temperament,

34:26.590 --> 34:27.440
I would assume

34:27.440 --> 34:29.219
you liked Yimeng instead.

34:29.489 --> 34:31.090
She's so high-maintenance.

34:31.239 --> 34:32.969
I can't handle a girl like that.

34:35.150 --> 34:38.070
You like gentle and gracious girls then?

34:42.840 --> 34:44.489
It sounds familiar. How come?

34:44.489 --> 34:45.310
You see,

34:45.699 --> 34:47.670
the point isn't what kind of girls I like.

34:47.670 --> 34:49.280
-The point is...
-The point is

34:49.280 --> 34:50.280
that you're curious

34:50.280 --> 34:51.719
about the secret Yimeng is hiding.

34:51.719 --> 34:52.520
That's right.

34:52.880 --> 34:53.940
Want to find it out?

34:54.489 --> 34:55.290
Leave it to me.

34:58.630 --> 34:59.360
Yiting!

34:59.880 --> 35:00.990
Shangguan.

35:01.650 --> 35:02.850
What brings you here?

35:03.510 --> 35:04.800
What is this place?

35:05.110 --> 35:06.510
What are you hiding here?

35:06.960 --> 35:08.190
Does it have something to do

35:08.190 --> 35:10.190
with you refusing to marry Nan Heng?

35:11.650 --> 35:12.880
How is that possible?

35:13.040 --> 35:14.770
Yiting, you're overthinking it.

35:14.770 --> 35:16.760
This is where I usually...

35:18.030 --> 35:18.880
This...

35:19.070 --> 35:19.880
Miss Yiting.

35:19.900 --> 35:20.830
Mr. Shangguan.

35:23.960 --> 35:25.420
Why are my paintings here?

35:28.280 --> 35:29.080
I...

35:29.190 --> 35:30.630
I'm about

35:31.030 --> 35:32.420
to leave, aren't I?

35:32.510 --> 35:33.600
Before that,

35:33.710 --> 35:35.390
I thought I should at least

35:35.480 --> 35:36.840
fix you two up.

35:46.620 --> 35:47.720
Yunlong, Shanhu!

35:48.960 --> 35:49.880
Yunlong, Shanhu!

35:49.880 --> 35:50.800
Over here!

35:52.310 --> 35:54.510
Guys, put whatever you're doing aside!

35:54.710 --> 35:56.070
His Highness has an important task

35:56.070 --> 35:57.250
for you.

35:59.000 --> 36:03.510
[Premises for sale]

36:04.280 --> 36:05.220
Yingqiu,

36:05.290 --> 36:06.280
thanks to you,

36:06.320 --> 36:08.030
they didn't find out my secret.

36:08.030 --> 36:09.030
You did a great job.

36:09.030 --> 36:10.250
After working for me for so long,

36:10.250 --> 36:11.440
you've really smartened up.

36:11.440 --> 36:13.230
You'd hate to let out your secret.

36:13.230 --> 36:15.070
Of course I would help you cover it up.

36:15.070 --> 36:15.670
My Lady!

36:16.230 --> 36:16.760
My Lady!

36:16.760 --> 36:17.550
Bad news.

36:17.590 --> 36:18.630
The Waning River Crescent...

36:18.630 --> 36:20.430
There's shocking news about it.

36:21.800 --> 36:23.070
Since the Seventh Prince
is the crown prince now,

36:23.070 --> 36:24.400
he is determined to
disband the Nightwalkers

36:24.400 --> 36:25.880
and sell the premises
of the Waning River Crescent.

36:25.880 --> 36:26.400
My Lady,

36:26.400 --> 36:28.400
please go and see what is happening.

36:29.000 --> 36:29.960
I have to check it out.

36:29.960 --> 36:31.150
Hold on, My Lady.

36:31.590 --> 36:32.400
My Lady,

36:32.780 --> 36:35.510
Mr. Shangguan tried to
persuade you not long ago.

36:35.710 --> 36:38.670
Now, the Seventh Prince plans
to disband the Nightwalkers.

36:38.670 --> 36:40.400
It all sounds fishy too me.

36:40.400 --> 36:41.760
Could there be a trap?

36:43.070 --> 36:44.080
Speak your mind.

36:44.360 --> 36:45.530
What kind of trap?

36:45.880 --> 36:47.210
Think about it, My Lady.

36:47.610 --> 36:49.550
It's a typical plot in storybooks

36:49.640 --> 36:52.050
that when the romance
between a woman and a man is challenged,

36:52.050 --> 36:54.250
their loyal servants would offer help.

36:54.550 --> 36:56.440
Given the way that the people

36:56.440 --> 36:58.480
of the Seventh Prince work, could they be

36:58.480 --> 37:00.740
luring you to the Waning River Crescent?

37:02.990 --> 37:04.260
You have a point.

37:05.360 --> 37:06.150
Well...

37:06.800 --> 37:08.860
Since when have you become so clever?

37:08.880 --> 37:09.670
My Lady,

37:09.670 --> 37:11.650
you speak of the script all the time.

37:11.650 --> 37:13.230
Even a knucklehead such as myself

37:13.230 --> 37:14.670
has learned something.

37:15.880 --> 37:18.480
Shall we go to
the Waning River Crescent or not?

37:24.440 --> 37:25.760
I'm begging you.

37:26.230 --> 37:27.630
If you lend me 800 taels,

37:27.630 --> 37:29.290
I'll do anything you ask me to,

37:30.910 --> 37:32.310
including marrying you.

37:35.500 --> 37:36.800
You shun me

37:36.800 --> 37:38.230
when you don't need favors.

37:38.230 --> 37:39.480
But when you do,

37:39.480 --> 37:40.760
you humbly beg me.

37:41.150 --> 37:41.960
Why?

37:42.030 --> 37:43.800
Do I look like a pushover to you?

37:43.880 --> 37:45.810
I-I wouldn't think of you that way.

37:46.740 --> 37:47.900
Then in your heart,

37:47.930 --> 37:50.060
am I a girl you can't communicate with?

37:54.620 --> 37:55.940
It seems like

37:56.350 --> 37:59.010
the Waning River Crescent
really is in trouble.

38:00.650 --> 38:01.440
Yiting,

38:03.150 --> 38:04.560
during all this time,

38:04.880 --> 38:07.140
I've never mentioned how much I love you,

38:07.870 --> 38:09.720
but the unsaid words are deeply

38:09.840 --> 38:11.030
buried in my heart.

38:12.890 --> 38:13.950
If I am to marry you,

38:14.230 --> 38:16.160
I'd better have a decent job first.

38:17.040 --> 38:19.440
Otherwise, how can I face your parents?

38:20.610 --> 38:23.010
If the Waning River Crescent is disbanded,

38:23.110 --> 38:24.630
I will go on to be

38:24.760 --> 38:27.360
a homeless nobody
from the martial arts world.

38:27.710 --> 38:29.070
I'm fine with

38:29.280 --> 38:30.240
such a hard life,

38:30.830 --> 38:32.690
but I can't let you suffer with me.

38:37.040 --> 38:38.100
Say your lines!

38:44.260 --> 38:45.260
I know

38:45.880 --> 38:48.330
I've always given you the cold shoulder.

38:48.630 --> 38:50.480
But if I didn't love you,

38:50.590 --> 38:51.840
why would I, a useless man,

38:51.840 --> 38:53.780
have put up with such tedious practice

38:53.780 --> 38:55.310
of the four arts for so long?

38:57.670 --> 38:59.990
It is true that the Waning River Crescent
is in trouble.

38:59.990 --> 39:01.470
It is also true that I want

39:05.880 --> 39:07.290
to be with you.

39:10.800 --> 39:12.280
Call we a coward or a wimp

39:12.670 --> 39:14.050
as you please.

39:14.540 --> 39:16.540
Now that I've poured my heart out...

39:29.720 --> 39:30.350
Move.

39:37.400 --> 39:38.550
Didn't you say it was just an act?

39:38.550 --> 39:39.320
Why did you

39:39.340 --> 39:40.510
add a kissing scene?

39:40.510 --> 39:41.500
Anything wrong with it?

39:41.500 --> 39:42.550
You don't get to

39:42.550 --> 39:43.880
decide the entire act.

39:44.730 --> 39:47.280
For plucking my heartstrings
with those words,

39:47.280 --> 39:49.670
you had to pay a price.

39:50.190 --> 39:52.890
I didn't play at full strength,

39:52.910 --> 39:54.840
yet you were already overwhelmed.

39:55.670 --> 39:57.000
Mr. Shangguan,

39:57.270 --> 39:58.930
you're just a glorified hero.

40:00.830 --> 40:01.520
Wait...

40:14.750 --> 40:16.540
Hurry! She's here!

40:18.660 --> 40:20.230
What can we do now?

40:20.230 --> 40:22.400
Chief doesn't want us anymore.

40:23.320 --> 40:25.630
Can somebody help us?

40:26.400 --> 40:28.150
Chief is abandoning us.

40:28.150 --> 40:29.760
Where can we go?

40:29.760 --> 40:31.510
Can somebody help us?

40:32.800 --> 40:34.130
We're left in the lurch!

40:34.440 --> 40:35.230
Shanhu.

40:35.340 --> 40:36.330
Mrs. Li!

40:36.440 --> 40:38.070
Mrs. Li, you finally came.

40:38.070 --> 40:39.880
Please help us!

40:39.880 --> 40:41.320
Chief is chasing us away.

40:41.320 --> 40:42.550
But where else

40:42.550 --> 40:44.030
can we go?

40:44.030 --> 40:45.280
Right, guys?

40:45.280 --> 40:46.880
Yes!

40:49.070 --> 40:49.880
Where is he?

40:49.880 --> 40:50.760
Over there.

40:50.760 --> 40:51.920
-Over there.
-Over there.
